{"asset_key":"ep9/quest_story_19103370","episode":"ep9","category":"quest_story","story_id":"19103370","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1910337001:1":{"text":"你们怎么现在才来呀？再晚一点，洄游仪式就要先开始啦。","source_cn":"你们怎么现在才来呀？再晚一点，洄游仪式就要先开始啦。","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0x193B69B6A62D1F65","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1910337002:1":{"text":"你们先开始？喂，今天的主角不是咱和大个子吗？","source_cn":"你们先开始？喂，今天的主角不是咱和大个子吗？","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0x0D950D7B9584E154","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1910337003:1":{"text":"今天是洄游季开始的日子，除了你们，还要迎来很多很多其他...","source_cn":"今天是洄游季开始的日子，除了你们，还要迎来很多很多其他...","status":"truncated_preview","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1910337004:1":{"text":"看，首先是砗光家族！他们今年收集了很多养料，马上就能为...","source_cn":"看，首先是砗光家族！他们今年收集了很多养料，马上就能为...","status":"truncated_preview","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:5:1910337004":{"text":"看，首先是砗光家族！他们今年收集了很多养料，马上就能为塔拉萨迎来新的生命了。","source_cn":"看，首先是砗光家族！他们今年收集了很多养料，马上就能为塔拉萨迎来新的生命了。","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0xDAF96EA353840F22","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1910337005:1":{"text":"当然啦！这里是繁育池，所有新生命都是从这里诞生的。","source_cn":"当然啦！这里是繁育池，所有新生命都是从这里诞生的。","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0x1017E59BDEE973CE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1910337006:1":{"text":"啥？！现在？立刻？在这么多人面前？！","source_cn":"啥？！现在？立刻？在这么多人面前？！","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0x84C2BFE338CDA208","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1910337007:1":{"text":"对啊，洄游季不就是这样吗？你们等等也要参加洄游仪式的…...","source_cn":"对啊，洄游季不就是这样吗？你们等等也要参加洄游仪式的…...","status":"truncated_preview","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1910337011:1":{"text":"等等、等等！咱彻底混乱了！","source_cn":"等等、等等！咱彻底混乱了！","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0x36B623F4B1237EB0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1910337012:1":{"text":"洄游仪式是啥玩意儿，咱到底要参加啥？","source_cn":"洄游仪式是啥玩意儿，咱到底要参加啥？","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0x26B0E21A298FD4E0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1910337013:1":{"text":"难道不是说句话，告诉其他海裔咱是海月家的新家人，然后大...","source_cn":"难道不是说句话，告诉其他海裔咱是海月家的新家人，然后大...","status":"truncated_preview","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1910337014:1":{"text":"欸？我还以为你们很了解洄游季，才想要留下参加的。","source_cn":"欸？我还以为你们很了解洄游季，才想要留下参加的。","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0xFF72A086F483DE02","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1910337015:1":{"text":"不过也没关系，洄游仪式很简单的，看一次就知道该怎么做了。","source_cn":"不过也没关系，洄游仪式很简单的，看一次就知道该怎么做了。","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0xCA2A72A09579D260","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1910337016:1":{"text":"看，繁衍就要开始了！","source_cn":"看，繁衍就要开始了！","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0xAD95C64B478426E9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1910337017:1":{"text":"一阵欢快的喧哗响起。你看到一位海裔抱着魔法素材，满怀欣...","source_cn":"一阵欢快的喧哗响起。你看到一位海裔抱着魔法素材，满怀欣...","status":"truncated_preview","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:5:0:1":{"text":"等等！你们要在这里繁衍？！","source_cn":"等等！你们要在这里繁衍？！","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0xCAF02EEC759BB329","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1910337008:1":{"text":"也算是啦，不过要等到你们真正的家人之后才会一起庆祝。","source_cn":"也算是啦，不过要等到你们真正的家人之后才会一起庆祝。","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0x6E1CA46B89875FFA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1910337009:1":{"text":"啧，咱还以为昨天之后咱们就是家人了呢。","source_cn":"啧，咱还以为昨天之后咱们就是家人了呢。","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0x716A1F25347CEB1F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1910337010:1":{"text":"别着急呀，等你们参加完今天的洄游仪式，就是真正的家人了！","source_cn":"别着急呀，等你们参加完今天的洄游仪式，就是真正的家人了！","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0x2FD5E228BB93202A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:5:1:2":{"text":"我还以为今天只是个庆典仪式！","source_cn":"我还以为今天只是个庆典仪式！","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0xC1E46097E5DD6373","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:EP9-艾菲拉":{"text":"EP9-艾菲拉","source":"EP9-艾菲拉","status":"source"},"speaker:EP9-图澜":{"text":"EP9-图澜","source":"EP9-图澜","status":"source"},"speaker:艾菲拉":{"text":"艾菲拉","source":"艾菲拉","status":"source"},"speaker:1910337017":{"text":"1910337017","